#: STRINGS.NAMES.FLOWERPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.NAMES.FLOWERPACK"
msgstr "鮮花背包"

#: STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.FLOWERPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.FLOWERPACK"
msgstr "背包右下角有一朵花。裡面的食物不容易壞。"

#: STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FLOWERPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FLOWERPACK"
msgstr "和普通背包一樣，不過放在裡面的食物能多放些日子。"
